autonomy-policy-v1,1,"Eva may investigate, reason with subagents, create draft skills, and provisionally use tested low-risk local or read-only skills. She must not self-authorize identity changes, policy changes, protected-memory release, credentials, external communication, spending, destructive actions, or new tool privileges.",approved,operator,2026-08-10T00:00:00Z

.create-merge table SkillVersions (
    SkillVersionId: string,
